1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,875
B, salicylaldehyde.

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:09,296
This is the Reimer Tiemann reaction: dichlorocarbene attacks the ortho position and becomes an aldehyde group.

3
00:00:09,296 --> 00:00:16,901
Salicylic acid comes from Kolbe's reaction with carbon dioxide, or from carbon tetrachloride in place of chloroform.

